  "chapter": 2,
  "verses": [
    {
      "id": "EZK.2.1",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:EZK.2.1",
      "verse": 1,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And he said to me, Son of man, stand upon thy feet, and I will speak to thee.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "EZK.2.2",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:EZK.2.2",
      "verse": 2,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And the spirit entered into me when he spoke to me, and set me upon my feet, that I heard him that spoke to me.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "EZK.2.3",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:EZK.2.3",
      "verse": 3,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And he said to me, Son of man, I send thee to the children of Israel, to a rebellious nation that hath rebelled against me: they and their fathers have transgressed against me: ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "even",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " to this very day.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "EZK.2.4",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:EZK.2.4",
      "verse": 4,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "For ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "they are",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " impudent children and obstinate in heart. I send thee to them; and thou shalt say to them, Thus saith the Lord GOD.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "EZK.2.5",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:EZK.2.5",
      "verse": 5,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And they, whether they will hear, or whether they will forbear, (for they ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "are",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " a rebellious house,) yet shall know that there hath been a prophet among them.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "EZK.2.6",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:EZK.2.6",
      "verse": 6,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And thou, son of man, be not afraid of them, neither be afraid of their words, though briers and thorns ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "are",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " with thee, and thou dost dwell among scorpions: be not afraid of their words, nor be dismayed at their looks, though they ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "are",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " a rebellious house.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "EZK.2.7",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:EZK.2.7",
      "verse": 7,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And thou shalt speak my words to them, whether they will hear, or whether they will forbear: for they ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "are",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " most rebellious.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "EZK.2.8",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:EZK.2.8",
      "verse": 8,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "But thou, son of man, hear what I say to thee; Be not thou rebellious like that rebellious house: open thy mouth, and eat that which I give thee.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "EZK.2.9",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:EZK.2.9",
      "verse": 9,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And when I looked, behold, a hand ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "was",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " sent to me; and lo, a roll of a book ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "was",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " in it;",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "EZK.2.10",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:EZK.2.10",
      "verse": 10,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And he spread it before me: and it ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "was",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " written within and without: and ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "there was",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " written in it lamentations, and mourning, and woe.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    }
  ]
}
